    "name_raw": "Growth in Ash",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Elemental Master's Handbook pg. 6",
    "definition_raw": "Source Elemental Master's Handbook pg. 6\nYou’re aware that when fire passes, growth can begin.\n\nBenefit: When you succeed at a Reflex save to avoid catching on fire, or when you cease taking ongoing fire damage from a spell or effect, you can smear ash on yourself as an immediate action to gain fast healing 1 for 3 rounds. For every Hit Die you have beyond 3, extend the duration of this fast healing by an additional round.",
